   "date": "2018-10-12T17:14:01Z",
   "subject": "Re: Analyze 7.5 Read Error: Negative Extents to Matrix",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "I’ll look into this."
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "3aFF-QlwAQAJ",
   "from": "Andrew Goodenough",
   "author": "e5371cb7ccb9b3ec",
   "date": "2019-09-04T16:08:59Z",
   "subject": "Re: Analyze 7.5 Read Error: Negative Extents to Matrix",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Kylie,<div><br></div><div>Using the readMSIData() from Cardinal 2.0, I get a bit more information. This is the error message I get now:</div><div><br></div><div><div>Error in validObject(x) : </div><div>  invalid class “atoms” object: 1: &#39;extent&#39; contains negative indices</div><div>invalid class “atoms” object: 2: &#39;index_extent&#39; contains negative indices</div></div><div><br></div><div>Hopefully that will provide more help. I don&#39;t think there is an issue with the datasets as they work normally in MSiReader and ABSciex&#39;s TissueView, but these just can&#39;t compete with Cardinal. I can send the datasets as well if that would make troubleshooting easier.</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks,</div><div>Andrew</div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "786jBI2XAwAJ",
   "from": "Sven Sondhauss",
   "author": "ae95740d463ec9b9",
   "date": "2019-11-14T01:18:51Z",
   "subject": "Re: Analyze 7.5 Read Error: Negative Extents to Matrix",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hey Kylie, Andrew and Melanie,</div><div><br></div><div>I have the same problem with some of my files. I had a look around in the code and it seems the problem is the bin size/number of m/z values. The Analyze format supports up to 65535 m/z values. When those are imported into R by Cardinal, it uses the &#39;short&quot; data type. But that converts values above 32767 into a negative value (the range for &#39;short&#39; is -32768 to 32767). As a simple solution, I suggest using the &#39;unsigned short&#39; format, which only uses positive values (range from 0 to 65355).</div><div>This can be done by changing the .makeAnalyzeHDR function:<br></div><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">makeAnalyzeHDR </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">file</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mode</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  header_key </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sizeof_hdr </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data_type </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">char</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                       db_name </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">char</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">18</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> extents </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">int</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> session_error </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">short</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                       regular </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">char</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> hkey_un0 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">char</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> filename </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> file</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                       filemode </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mode</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> offset </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  image_dimension </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">struct</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dim </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><b><span style=\"color:#008\">ushort</span></b><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">8</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> unused8 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">short</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> # change </span><span style=\"color:#000\"><code><span style=\"color:#000\">&quot;dim </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><b><span style=\"color:#008\">short</span></b><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">8</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></code>&quot; to &quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><code><span style=\"color:#000\">dim </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><b><span style=\"color:#008\">ushort</span></b><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">8</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)&quot;<br></span></code>                            unused9 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">short</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> unused10 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">short</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> unused11 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">short</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                            unused12 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">short</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> unused13 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">short</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> unused14 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">short</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                            datatype </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">short</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> bitpix </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">short</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> dim_un0 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">short</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                            pixdim </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#0